Package: uuyc-linux-controller
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: UU Remote for Linux Contributors
Depends: bash, ca-certificates, coreutils, curl, ethtool, findutils, gir1.2-appindicator3-0.1, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, iproute2, libglib2.0-bin, libx11-6, network-manager, policykit-1, python3, python3-gi, systemd, tar, util-linux
Recommends: wine (>= 11.1) | winehq-stable (>= 11.1) | winehq-devel (>= 11.1) | winehq-staging (>= 11.1), libnotify-bin, zenity, pciutils
Suggests: vainfo
Description: unofficial UU Remote controller compatibility wrapper
 Runs the official NetEase UU Remote Windows client in an isolated Wine prefix
 for controller-side validation on Linux. The proprietary upstream installer
 is downloaded from NetEase on first setup and is not included in this package.
